OL,3,GNEWSALabour lost its connection with
OL,4,Avoters, says Welsh leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour lost its connection with
OL,7,Fpreviously loyal voters at May's Senedd
OL,8,Felection, the party's leader has said.
OL,10,FOfficials will publish on Saturday a
OL,11,Freview of Labour's historic election
OL,12,Fdefeat in the May Senedd election.
OL,14,FSpeaking to BBC Wales, Ken Skates said
OL,15,Fit was "absolutely obvious" that the
OL,16,Fparty needed to rediscover its purpose
OL,17,Fand reconnect with people the "length
OL,18,Fand breadth of Wales".
OL,20,FLabour was thrown out of power at the
OL,21,Felection when it was reduced from 30
OL,22,Fseats in the Welsh Parliament to nine.
